{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤングギターの表紙を乃木團の6人で飾らせていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてギターを手にとって撮影したのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段はギターじゃないので持ち方とかもわからず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこを触っていいのかとかどこに当たったらダメなんだろ〜...ってドキドキしながら撮影しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"数々のトップアーティストさんが表紙を飾っていて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回で日本人は4人目らしいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"対談もさせて頂いて...とても刺激を受けました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時の写真です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてもうすぐライブですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみのですが、ななみんの卒業が初日にあると思うとなんだか寂しい気持ちもあります..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝の気持ちを込めて最高に楽しいライブにしたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西武ドームでは凍えるような寒さだったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はさいたまスーパーアリーナなので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"屋根付いてますよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばるぞーーーー！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"酉年だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんお誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は10代最後ご飯を一緒に行こうっていってたけどその後私の仕事の時間の都合で行けなくなっちゃって残念だった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボイスメッセージを元気一杯に送りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんとは毎日一緒にくっついて楽しんでます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごく美人で綺麗なのにとっても面白いギャップが大好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またお泊まりしようね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにこの写真かずみんと私となりに並んでるのですがお互いビションフリーゼという犬種がすぎて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意味わからないんですけど一応2人でビションポーズしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お料理失敗しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人参いつも湯がくのですが電子レンジで柔らかくしようとしたらやり過ぎちゃってすっごく小さくなって焦げました...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてゆでたまごです..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体内時計でゆでたまご作ってたのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お腹空き過ぎて半熟を作って食べよう！！！っと思ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな湯がけてなくて殻を破るとこんな感じになっててショックでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バナナゼロミュージックにかずみんかりんちゃんまあや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の三人で出演させていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋もずーっと大盛り上がりで番組収録も楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バナナマンさんも居たし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じチームには小峠さんもいていい意味でリラックスした状態でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クイズとっても難しかったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考える時間も楽しかったしわかったときは何と言っても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スッキリーーー！！！！！！わーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じで楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じチームの小峠さんはなんもわからなかったらしいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて日だっ！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間の時間でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/02/18/9856121/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に、ブログ更新が遅くなってごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その間コメントや755を読みました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも応援してくれてありがとうございます！\nこれからも頑張って行きます"}],"source":"archive"}